# main.cpp — Coordinator Entry Point
# Files: src/coordinator/main.cpp

## PURPOSE
Boot sequence and main loop for the ESP32-S3 coordinator.

## BOOT ORDER
1. Serial 115200, 2s delay for monitor
2. LittleFS.begin(true) — format on first boot
3. Storage check: warn if <300KB free
4. activationManager.begin() — license validation
5. PuckNetwork::begin() — WiFi AP + ESP-NOW
6. WebHandler::begin() — web server + DNS
7. GameManager::begin() — stats init

## MAIN LOOP
PuckNetwork::update() → WebHandler::update() → GameManager::update() → WifiScanner::loop()
All called every iteration, no delays.

## GLOBALS
- ActivationManager activationManager — singleton, accessed by WebHandler
- SYSTEM_VERSION "1.6-Debug" — shown in /api/version

## DEPENDENCIES
Common.h, WebHandler.h, GameManager.h, PuckNetwork.h, WifiScanner.h, ActivationManager.h
